          deckDescription: 'Standard 36-card deck: nine ranks (A, 10, K, Q, J, 9, 8, 7, 6) in four French suits (spades, hearts, diamonds, clubs). Formed by removing 2s, 3s, 4s, and 5s from a standard 52-card deck.',
